caption: <$hgsd.convert>
title: hgsd.convert widget
tags: Documentation [[HyperGSD API]]

! Introduction
The convert widget turns the current Action tiddler into a Project tiddler in one click: it removes the `$:/GSD/Action` tag, adds `$:/GSD/Project`, clears `gsd_prerequisites`, and sets the new project's status — `active` if the action was `next`, otherwise `future`.

! Content and Attributes
The widget's content becomes the button label (defaults to `convert`).

|!Attribute |!Description |
|current-status |The action's current `gsd_status`; determines the resulting project status |
|class, style, aria-label, role, tooltip |Standard button attributes |

! Example
```
<$hgsd.convert current-status={{!!gsd_status}} class="tc-btn-invisible">↰ project</$hgsd.convert>
```